  "details": "Contents gating is a good system to allow users can choose what to see, or don't wanna see. However, I think it can be more comfortable to make the filter separete against avatars and worlds. For example, people who want to explore bloody spooky worlds but hate gore expressions in the avatars, might want to turn off \" Filter Excessive Gore Expression\" to find horror world, but want to turn it on to avoid gore avatars. Current system can not meet these needs because the filters block both worlds and avatars.",
